+---
+"@biomejs/biome": patch
+---
+
+Fixed a regression where [`noUnusedVariables`](https://biomejs.dev/linter/rules/no-unused-variables/) reported variables used only through Astro shorthand attributes, such as `<MyComponent {text} />`, as unused.
